iv></div></div></main><div class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-900" id="updates" tabindex="-1"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-full px-4 pt-10 md:pt-24 xl:max-w-screen-xl xl:px-16"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between lg:flex-row lg:gap-12"><div class="w-full lg:w-[30%]"><div class="mb-6 h-10 w-10"><img src="assets/icon.svg" width="42" height="42" alt="" /></div><p class="text-xl font-medium text-pretty text-laravel-red">LaravelJS explores a more consistent way to<br class="block lg:hidden"> build, deploy, and monitor software.</p><div class="mt-8 max-w-md"><div><form data-hs-do-not-collect="" novalidate class="space-y-3"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><label for="cloud-newsletter-firstname" class="sr-only">First name</label><input id="cloud-newsletter-firstname" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="First name" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-neutral-900 placeholder-neutral-400 shadow-xs transition-colors duration-100 hover:border-neutral-400 focus:border-neutral-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-neutral-300 sm:text-sm dark:border-neutral-600 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100 dark:placeholder-neutral-500 dark:hover:border-neutral-500 dark:focus:border-neutral-500 dark:focus:ring-neutral-600"></div><div><label for="cloud-newsletter-lastname" class="sr-only">Last name</label><input id="cloud-newsletter-lastname" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" placeholder="Last name" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-neutral-900 placeholder-neutral-400 shadow-xs transition-colors duration-100 hover:border-neutral-400 focus:border-neutral-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-neutral-300 sm:text-sm dark:border-neutral-600 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100 dark:placeholder-neutral-500 dark:hover:border-neutral-500 dark:focus:border-neutral-500 dark:focus:ring-neutral-600"></div></div><div><label for="cloud-newsletter-email" class="sr-only">Email address</label><input id="cloud-newsletter-email" type="email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Email address" aria-invalid="false" class="w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-neutral-900 placeholder-neutral-400 shadow-xs transition-colors duration-100 hover:border-neutral-400 focus:border-neutral-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-neutral-300 sm:text-sm dark:border-neutral-600 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100 dark:placeholder-neutral-500 dark:hover:border-neutral-500 dark:focus:border-neutral-500 dark:focus:ring-neutral-600"></div><div><div></div></div><button type="button" class="inline-flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium shadow-xs transition-colors duration-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-200 focus-visible:ring-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-100 dark:hover:bg-neutral-600">Stay updated</button><p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Visual preview only. This form does not collect or send information.</p></form></div></div><ul class="my-8 flex items-center justify-start space-x-6 lg:my-16"><li><a href="https://github.com/pedromatosonv/laraveljs-landing" target="_blank" title="LaravelJS on GitHub" aria-label="LaravelJS on GitHub" class="text-neutral-500 transition duration-100 hover:text-neutral-700 dark:hover:text-neutral-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-6"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M0 12.305C0 17.74 3.438 22.352 8.207 23.979C8.807 24.092 9.027 23.712 9.027 23.386C9.027 23.094 9.016 22.32 9.01 21.293C5.671 22.037 4.967 19.643 4.967 19.643C4.422 18.223 3.635 17.845 3.635 17.845C2.545 17.081 3.718 17.096 3.718 17.096C4.